<title>Ecuador's security crisis: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ecuador/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ecuador-2026-11-23T15:05:04.863Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 15:05:04 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;US forces have launched their first land operation against cartels inside Ecuador while expanding military activities across Latin America. Ecuadorian fishermen have filed a $5 million lawsuit against the United States over a drone strike that sank their boat near the Galápagos. President Noboa has asked the United States for $430.5 billion in security aid and met with Pete Hegseth to discuss anti-narco cooperation, while prison gangs are now sending bills to families of inmates. Noboa rejected claims that former vice president Jorge Glas was tortured, saying his injuries were self-inflicted, and the UCDP recorded 2 battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxQRklvWklPTVl3ME52SnA0NF9YcmItc2xHeTRseGJydXJFUHo4c2NBcVZnRXlTYmRGVUlEdVlkNHVzUlgwM0NNaV9TcWNJTE5ZTlRkVUo4ZWpDY1Yxb25LU0JySndreUV4V3ZYejlUTnJsZDVqUzhMbk4xZUpjOGFoSUoxSUdiV3U0N2hjQU9abTdXOWx3d0xV?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxNS0J3akM1b0FNdUdUam1iZm1TNzZ5dEswSFlLVUUyMXFmR0hDa2NZRk9sZHJzWUpDWmZYZ3M4a283MEd5WGhyMHZIWVFTZHl3czRydXVERFNZaUJ4MzNIXzM4dFNwUm1qVGdFQ3JyMVlmcnBKR2hfU1BQb1pJTDg2bzFmcVFTUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sri Lanka Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxQaVlsN2FuNE82VGp2ZXBmTF9Odkk0OU5waE5qUGdMZnRRNjRtQlVWaTg4encxV1NiMU9FTWh4TnVLc09DN1dLOWlRRHczUDBsWjEzdk9vdzY2N0VldVlXdTBSQXBha3pfb3RrMDE4LUctbHE4eWxxbXRLVktPM28wZlZrNWpQcVM1WHF0bEl4MXdpdTZONVBsUzkwMGxmRHFPNTBiaFQ1UDNKSjVkd2JqVlRqclkzUWVPX09qUGxn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Le Monde.fr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxQYU0yT2dDTzZkYmtfLTJmSS1UZTNlc0cyWk1vZEpiM3JVNzFRaGdtMHNfNHpJUjRYaEJRU0p1OFlIb1RtU19rczlWclNCaGkxTVJaX2lybVFVa0pSc0stNVU2dFpaUHlMTWw0Y2R5c1d4SVVpS3NZd